{"seq":3,"slug":"peeking-srm","title":"过早看数与 SRM 样本比失衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-experiment-platform/metrics-significance/peeking-srm","wordCount":3516,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"过早看数与-srm-样本比失衡\">过早看数与 SRM 样本比失衡</h1><p>两个搜索实验的结论在三个月后同时被推翻了。第一个的报表上 p 值 0.003，被推翻了，原因是负责人在实验期内看了十一次结果，每次看到显著就去催「可以上了」。第二个的报表上效果更漂亮，也被推翻了，原因是它的分组比例从设计的 50:50 变成了 51.2:48.8——听起来只差 1.2 个百分点，但在一亿样本上这个偏差的 p 值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，意味着分流机制出了问题，而分流出问题的实验，其指标差异里的相当一部分来自机制本身而不是策略。</p>\n<p>这两个案例对应本文的两个主题：**过早看数（peeking）**与 <strong>SRM（Sample Ratio Mismatch，样本比失衡）</strong>。它们的共同点是都属于「统计结果看起来没问题但结论不可信」的情形，都属于必须在平台层面强制执行、而不是靠个人自觉的纪律。本文讲序贯检验如何让「随时可看」在统计上合法、SRM 的检验阈值为什么远严于 0.05、以及 SRM 报警之后从哪里开始排查。本文假定指标口径与样本量已经确定（见<a href=\"metric-pipeline-experiment\">实验指标计算与护栏指标</a>与<a href=\"statistical-power-mde\">显著性/功效/MDE 与样本量</a>），只处理「结果可信度」这一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-peeking-为什么抬高假阳性\">核心概念：peeking 为什么抬高假阳性</h2><p>固定样本检验（fixed-horizon test）的 p 值有一个隐含前提：<strong>检验只做一次</strong>，而且这次检验发生在样本量达到预定值时。如果在这之前反复看，每次看都是一次独立的检验机会，那么「至少有一次显著」的概率会远高于标称的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>假设做了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 次独立的检验，每次名义水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，则族错误率（family-wise error rate）为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FWER</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>K</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FWER} = 1 - (1-\\alpha)^K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FWER</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 时 FWER 约 0.40。实际的 peeking 比独立检验更复杂（各次检验的统计量高度相关，因为后面的样本包含前面），因此真实的膨胀没那么剧烈，但方向与量级是对的：一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 的检验，在被看了十次之后，真实的假阳性率通常在 0.15–0.25 之间。这一点在统计学里有一个经典结果——<strong>在样本量未固定时连续监测并用固定样本公式判定，几乎必然会在某个时刻看到「显著」</strong>，不论真实效果是否为零（来源：Johari, Koomen, Pekelis, Walsh, <em>Peeking at A/B Tests: Why it matters, and what to do about it</em>, KDD 2017, DOI 10.1145/3097983.3097992；以及同作者的 <em>Always Valid Inference: Bringing Sequential Analysis to A/B Testing</em>, arXiv:1512.04922, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.04922）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.04922）。</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[实验上线] --&gt; B[每日查看 p 值]&#10;    B --&gt; C{p &lt; 0.05 ?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[宣布显著并停止]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E{达到预定样本量?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[继续积累]&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[按固定样本判定]&#10;    D --&gt; H[假阳性率被抬高]&#10;    G --&gt; I[假阳性率 = alpha]&#10;    H --&gt; J[三个月后结论被推翻]\">graph TD\n    A[实验上线] --&gt; B[每日查看 p 值]\n    B --&gt; C{p &lt; 0.05 ?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[宣布显著并停止]\n    C --&gt;|否| E{达到预定样本量?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[继续积累]\n    F --&gt; B\n    E --&gt;|是| G[按固定样本判定]\n    D --&gt; H[假阳性率被抬高]\n    G --&gt; I[假阳性率 = alpha]\n    H --&gt; J[三个月后结论被推翻]</pre><p>有三种处理方式，它们对应不同的组织文化。</p>\n<p><strong>第一种：禁止 peeking。</strong> 平台在达到预定样本量之前隐藏 p 值，只展示「样本量进度」与护栏指标。这是最简单也最有效的做法：它把纪律做成了产品约束，而不是依赖发起人的自制力。代价是团队在实验期内完全没有效果方向的信号，有时候会错过一个明显有害的实验——但护栏指标仍然可见，因此真正的损害会被兜住。</p>\n<p><strong>第二种：序贯检验。</strong> 允许随时查看，但用统计上合法的边界替代固定样本的 p 值临界值。常用方案有两类：<strong>alpha spending</strong>（把总 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 按预设的查看次数分配，例如 O&#39;Brien-Fleming 边界，早期查看用极严的临界值、后期放宽——O&#39;Brien 与 Fleming 1979 年在 Biometrics 上提出的多重检验程序即为其源头，来源：O&#39;Brien, Fleming, <em>A Multiple Testing Procedure for Clinical Trials</em>, Biometrics, 1979, DOI 10.2307/2530245）与<strong>always-valid 置信序列</strong>（构造一条随时间始终有效的置信序列，任意时刻的越界都是合法发现）。序贯检验的代价是<strong>功效损失</strong>：同样的样本量，序贯检验的 MDE 比固定样本大 5%–20%，取决于查看次数与边界方案。</p>\n<p><strong>第三种：贝叶斯方法。</strong> 报告后验概率而不是 p 值（例如「P(B 优于 A) = 0.96」），它天然容忍连续监测，因为后验分布随着数据积累而更新，不存在「多次检验」的概念。代价是它需要一个先验，而先验的选择会影响结论，这在组织内解释起来比 p 值更费力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>允许 peeking</th>\n<th>假阳性控制</th>\n<th>功效损失</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>禁止 peeking</td>\n<td>否（产品约束）</td>\n<td>严格</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>默认方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alpha spending</td>\n<td>是（按预设次数）</td>\n<td>严格</td>\n<td>5%–20%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需要早期信号的实验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Always-valid 置信序列</td>\n<td>是（任意时刻）</td>\n<td>严格</td>\n<td>5%–20%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>看板实时展示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贝叶斯后验</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>依赖先验</td>\n<td>无（相对）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>组织能接受贝叶斯表述</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中的组合是：<strong>默认禁止 peeking（只展示样本量进度与护栏），护栏与止损场景使用 always-valid 边界</strong>。这个组合的理由是：效果判定不需要早期信号（多等几天成本很低），而护栏止损需要随时可判定（延迟恶化不能等两周）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"srm-分流机制的体检\">SRM：分流机制的体检</h2><p>SRM 是指实际分流比例与设计比例的显著偏离。它之所以必须作为独立检查项，是因为它与指标计算完全无关——它是一个<strong>分流机制的体检</strong>，而分流机制一旦出问题，指标差异就可能混入机制性的偏差。</p>\n<p>检验方法用卡方拟合优度检验。设实验有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个组，设计比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，观测样本数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，总数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\sum n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（卡方拟合优度检验的标准形式即比较分箱观测频数与期望频数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2=\\sum (O_i-E_i)^2/E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，来源：NIST/SEMATECH e-Handbook of Statistical Methods, 1.3.5.15，<a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda35f.htm）：\">https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda35f.htm）：</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\frac{(n_i - N p_i)^2}{N p_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>自由度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。以两组 50:50、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为例：若观测比例是 51.2:48.8，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>5.76</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2 \\approx 5.76\\times 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.76</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，p 值远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——这就是上面那个案例。</p>\n<p><strong>阈值为什么必须远严于 0.05？</strong> 因为 SRM 检查在每个实验的每一天都要做，检查次数极多。若用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>，那么在一百个实验、每个跑十四天的情况下，会有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\times14\\times0.05 = 70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span></span></span></span></span> 次误报。团队会在两周内学会忽略 SRM 告警。行业里通行的做法是把阈值设在 <strong>p &lt; 0.0005</strong>（对应约 3.5 个标准差），并且对「接近阈值」的情况用告警等级区分（p&lt;0.001 为红色、p&lt;0.01 为黄色）——这个「远严于常规显著性水平」的阈值与分类学正是微软等平台在跨四个公司、数百个实验的实践基础上总结出的经验规则（来源：Fabijan 等, <em>Diagnosing Sample Ratio Mismatch in Online Controlled Experiments: A Taxonomy and Rules of Thumb for Practitioners</em>, KDD 2019, DOI 10.1145/3292500.3330722）。</p>\n<p>还有一条必须遵守的细节：<strong>SRM 检验必须用「进入实验的样本数」，而不是「有指标数据的样本数」。</strong> 如果用后者，一个「导致上报失败」的实验变体会让某组的样本数凭空减少，SRM 检验会把事故掩盖成「两组人数差不多」。正确的参照量是分流日志里的分桶记录数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SRM 表现</th>\n<th>p 值范围</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>比例接近设计值</td>\n<td>p &gt; 0.01</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻微偏离</td>\n<td>0.0005 &lt; p &lt; 0.01</td>\n<td>黄色告警</td>\n<td>记录，观察是否持续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显著偏离</td>\n<td>p &lt; 0.0005</td>\n<td>红色告警</td>\n<td>实验结论不可用，必须排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比例严重扭曲</td>\n<td>p &lt; 1e-10</td>\n<td>阻断</td>\n<td>停止实验，排查分流实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[每日 SRM 检查] --&gt; B[取分桶日志样本数]&#10;    B --&gt; C[卡方拟合优度检验]&#10;    C --&gt; D{p 值}&#10;    D --&gt;|&gt; 0.01| E[正常]&#10;    D --&gt;|0.0005-0.01| F[黄色: 记录观察]&#10;    D --&gt;|&lt; 0.0005| G[红色: 结论不可用]&#10;    G --&gt; H{排查路径}&#10;    H --&gt; I[分桶实现跨端一致?]&#10;    I --&gt; J[配置下发是否全量生效?]&#10;    J --&gt; K[是否有过滤在分配阶段?]&#10;    K --&gt; L[样本数取值是否正确?]&#10;    L --&gt; M[定位并修复后重跑实验]\">graph TD\n    A[每日 SRM 检查] --&gt; B[取分桶日志样本数]\n    B --&gt; C[卡方拟合优度检验]\n    C --&gt; D{p 值}\n    D --&gt;|&gt; 0.01| E[正常]\n    D --&gt;|0.0005-0.01| F[黄色: 记录观察]\n    D --&gt;|&lt; 0.0005| G[红色: 结论不可用]\n    G --&gt; H{排查路径}\n    H --&gt; I[分桶实现跨端一致?]\n    I --&gt; J[配置下发是否全量生效?]\n    J --&gt; K[是否有过滤在分配阶段?]\n    K --&gt; L[样本数取值是否正确?]\n    L --&gt; M[定位并修复后重跑实验]</pre><h2 id=\"srm-的排查路径\">SRM 的排查路径</h2><p>SRM 报警之后的排查有固定的顺序，从最可能的原因开始，每一步都有明确的检查动作。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，检查分桶实现的跨端一致性。</strong> 这是最高频的原因。三个典型子问题：某个服务用了错误的哈希实现（见<a href=\"../traffic-bucketing/stable-hash-bucket\">稳定哈希分桶与一致性</a>中列出的四类事故）；某个服务的 ID 归一化方式不同（大小写、空格、编码）；某个服务的 salt 派生规则与其他服务不一致。检查动作是用跨语言金标准测试向量跑一遍所有服务。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，检查配置下发是否全量生效。</strong> 如果分桶正确但配置只在一部分机器上生效，那么「进入实验组」的用户里只有一部分真的看到了实验策略，而从指标侧看这部分用户会表现得像对照组。这会让实验组的指标偏离，同时<strong>也可能</strong>造成样本比失衡（如果某些机器上报了分桶记录但没有正确求值）。检查动作是对比「分桶记录数」与「实际获取到实验配置的请求数」。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，检查是否有过滤被放在了分配阶段。</strong> 如<a href=\"../traffic-bucketing/experiment-layer\">实验层：互斥与正交</a>与<a href=\"../traffic-bucketing/traffic-allocation\">流量比例与分层抽样</a>所强调，任何在分配阶段做的用户属性过滤都可能引入与指标相关的选择偏差，同时可能造成样本比失衡（如果过滤条件在不同组的实现略有差异）。</p>\n<p><strong>第四，检查样本数的取值。</strong> 这是最容易被忽略的一条：如果 SRM 检验用的是「有完整指标数据的样本」而不是「分桶样本」，那么一个「上报失败」或「埋点丢失」的实验变体就会呈现 SRM。此时根因不在分流而在埋点。这个区分很重要——它决定了下一次应该修分流还是修埋点。判断方法是把两个数字都算出来：分桶样本的 SRM 与有指标样本的 SRM。如果只有后者失衡，根因在埋点。</p>\n<p><strong>第五，检查时间维度的分布。</strong> 有时候整体比例是正常的，但某个小时的样本比严重失衡（例如某台新上线的机器配置未同步）。因此 SRM 检查应当<strong>按小时和按机器分组都做一遍</strong>，而不只做全局的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>排查步骤</th>\n<th>检查动作</th>\n<th>若命中，根因位置</th>\n<th>修复方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跨端一致性</td>\n<td>金标准向量跑所有服务</td>\n<td>分桶实现</td>\n<td>统一哈希与归一化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置生效</td>\n<td>对比分桶数 vs 求值数</td>\n<td>下发通道</td>\n<td>修推送/加回退告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配阶段过滤</td>\n<td>审查分流条件</td>\n<td>实验设计</td>\n<td>改为层内随机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本数取值</td>\n<td>分桶样本 vs 指标样本两个 SRM</td>\n<td>埋点</td>\n<td>修埋点或修上报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间/机器分组</td>\n<td>按小时、按机器分别检验</td>\n<td>局部配置漂移</td>\n<td>机器级配置同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"屏蔽与多指标-srm-之外的样本完整性检查\">屏蔽与多指标：SRM 之外的样本完整性检查</h2><p>SRM 检查的是<strong>总量</strong>比例，它不能发现「某一类用户的服务比失衡」。因此还需要两项补充检查。</p>\n<p><strong>按维度的 SRM（dimension-level SRM）</strong>：对关键维度（市场、客户端版本、会员等级、新老用户）分别做 SRM 检验。一个实验可能在整体上 50:50，但在某个市场是 45:55——这通常说明该市场的流量走了一条不同的代码路径（例如某个市场的搜索走的是另一个服务集群，而那个集群的配置没同步）。这类问题在跨境场景下出现频率很高。</p>\n<p><strong>样本代表性检查</strong>：比较实验组与对照组在实验前属性上的分布，例如「两组的实验前 CTR 分布是否相同」。这与 CUPED 用到的协变量是同一批数据（见<a href=\"statistical-power-mde\">显著性/功效/MDE 与样本量</a>）。如果两组在实验前就不同，那么随机化没有生效，指标差异的一部分会来自这个既存差异。一个好的实践是把这个检查做成报表的固定栏目，与 SRM 并列展示——它比 SRM 更灵敏，因为它能发现「比例对但人群不对」的情形（例如算法随机化在某个连续维度上留下偏差）。</p>\n<p>最后一条纪律：<strong>SRM 或代表性检查失败时，实验结论必须被标记为不可用，而不是「有偏差但可以参考」。</strong> 因为无法知道偏差的方向与量级，任何「参考」都是在做无根据的调整。平台的正确行为是把该实验的结论区置为「数据不可信：SRM 未通过」，并阻止它进入放量流程（见<a href=\"../ramp-rollback/canary-gradual-ramp\">灰度放量节奏</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>peeking 抬高假阳性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FWER</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>K</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FWER}=1-(1-\\alpha)^K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FWER</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，看十次后真实假阳性率可达 0.15–0.25。三种合法方案是<strong>禁止 peeking</strong>（产品约束隐藏 p 值，默认采用）、<strong>序贯检验</strong>（alpha spending 或 always-valid 置信序列，代价是 5%–20% 功效损失）、<strong>贝叶斯后验</strong>（依赖先验）。</li>\n<li>推荐组合：效果判定默认禁止 peeking，只展示样本量进度与护栏；护栏止损使用 always-valid 边界以支持随时判定。</li>\n<li><strong>SRM 用卡方拟合优度检验</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2=\\sum (n_i-Np_i)^2/(Np_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，阈值必须设在 <strong>p &lt; 0.0005</strong>（黄色在 0.0005–0.01），因为检查频次极高，用 0.05 会在两周内训练团队忽略告警。</li>\n<li>SRM 必须用<strong>分桶样本数</strong>而非有指标数据的样本数，否则埋点问题会被误判为分流问题；两者都算一遍可以区分根因位置。</li>\n<li>排查顺序：跨端分桶一致性 → 配置下发生效 → 分配阶段过滤 → 样本数取值 → 按时间与机器分组的局部漂移。</li>\n<li>SRM 之外还要做<strong>按维度 SRM</strong>（市场/版本/会员/新老用户）与<strong>实验前属性代表性检查</strong>；SRM 未通过的实验结论必须标记为不可用，并阻止其进入放量。</li>\n<li>分桶实现与 salt 的细节见<a href=\"../traffic-bucketing/stable-hash-bucket\">稳定哈希分桶与一致性</a>；结论不可用的实验如何在放量流程中被拦住，见<a href=\"../ramp-rollback/canary-gradual-ramp\">灰度放量节奏</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"过早看数与 SRM 样本比失衡","id":"过早看数与-srm-样本比失衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：peeking 为什么抬高假阳性","id":"核心概念-peeking-为什么抬高假阳性"},{"level":2,"text":"SRM：分流机制的体检","id":"srm-分流机制的体检"},{"level":2,"text":"SRM 的排查路径","id":"srm-的排查路径"},{"level":2,"text":"屏蔽与多指标：SRM 之外的样本完整性检查","id":"屏蔽与多指标-srm-之外的样本完整性检查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"显著性/功效/MDE 与样本量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-experiment-platform/metrics-significance/statistical-power-mde"},"next":{"title":"灰度放量节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-experiment-platform/ramp-rollback/canary-gradual-ramp"}}